OL,3,GNEWSAReform not suspending former
OL,4,Aleader arrested on suspicion of
OL,5,Aassault, says chief whip
OL,6,
OL,7,FA politician who quit as Reform UK's
OL,8,FWales leader after he was arrested for
OL,9,Fassault over the weekend will continue
OL,10,Fto represent the party in the Senedd,
OL,11,Fits chief whip LlE7r Powell has said.
OL,13,FDan Thomas also attended a meeting on
OL,14,Fthe Senedd estate in person on
OL,15,FWednesday to discuss how the party will
OL,16,Freplace him.
OL,18,FPowell said Reform had not considered
OL,19,Fsuspending the whip - which would
OL,20,Feffectively leave him as an independent
OL,21,FMS - and said he "had a right" to be at
OL,22,Fthe meeting.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
