OL,3,GNEWSAReform not suspending former
OL,4,Aleader arrested on suspicion of
OL,5,Aassault, says chief whip
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas quit on Tuesday after he was
OL,8,Farrested over the weekend on suspicion
OL,9,Fof assault and controlling or coercive
OL,10,Fbehaviour. He was bailed pending
OL,11,Ffurther enquiries, and denies doing
OL,12,Fanything wrong.
